   274	**Exit procedure.** When V1 stops issuing: destroy the keys (KMS scheduled deletion; hardware token reset), and
   275	publish an **end-of-issuance statement** as a signed git commit, OTS-stamped on its signed commit id. Verification
   276	of existing receipts does not need the private keys. **No V1 verifier rule consults the statement** (OWNER
   277	DECISION 2026-10-12). The issuance window (guarantee 2) bounds minting after exit; the statement is evidence for a
   278	later examiner only.
