    65	**What the P9 probe showed** (`formal/spike/tla-probes/P9/RESULTS-PROBE.md`
    66	F2–F4; three stateful verifiers written besides the pure one —
    67	`LIVE_FALLBACK`, `LIVE_FAILCLOSED`, `REPLAY_LATCH`. On the two-machine
    68	VECTOR configuration two of the three are wholly undetected
    69	(`LiveFallback_Vector.out`, `ReplayLatch_Vector.out`: both invariants
    70	green) and the third is caught only by the probe's `Purity`
    71	invariant — the expected-verdict oracle that §A4.1(ii) as worded does
