    73	passes all three). (a) A verifier that consults an optional service and falls
    74	back to the bundle when the service is unreachable is
    75	indistinguishable from a pure one on two isolated machines. (b) A
    76	fail-closed consulting verifier returns `UNVERIFIABLE` on both
