   343	## 4. The manifest frame (map-v1 tuple; G-08, G-14, G-22)
   344	
   345	```
   346	F_manifest = frame("tessera-v1/manifest", JCS({"alg":A,"issuer":D,"key_fp":fp_kms,"sset":[fp_gpg],"ver":"map-v1"}))
   347	manifest_sha256 = hex(SHA256(F_manifest))
   348	```
   349	
   350	- The schema is closed: `key_fp` must be a `spki-sha256:` string, and `sset` must hold exactly one `gpg-sha256:`
   351	  string. `ver` is exactly `map-v1`. Anything else is `SCHEMA`.
   352	- *Reason: this is the map-v1 tuple of R-3.36 in the slot order of the C-C2 trace (G-09). Each key's possession
   353	  proof (R-3.38) is its OpenPGP signature over this same frame. The `tessera-v1/manifest` tag keeps that
   354	  signature apart from the same key's attestation signature (P7).*
