   248	OpenPGP P-256 plus gpg OpenPGP P-256. The verification primitive is "an OpenPGP signature over the designated
   249	frame"; KMS signs a digest it cannot interpret. GPG runs on author-controlled hardware outside AWS, pulling from a
   250	queue with no inbound path, as registered ("local GPG", `phase-0-prereg.md:292-294`). V1's stated availability

