+8. **MEDIUM — “Repository key used only for rotations” contradicts the exit statement it must sign. Disposition: WORDING.**
+
+   **Evidence:** docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md:270-275; formal/p8/ENCODING-V1.md:659-660.
